      "created_at": "2013-02-04T23:48:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would like to answer, but the reality is that Christopher plays so quickly that when I'm in a game with him I'm usually happy if I can simply follow what's going on in the game, much less consider the details of what he's doing with his hero.</p>",
