      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-05T02:11:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When playing AZ, as noted, Christopher doesn't worry about his hit points. If he doesn't get cards that will move things forward, he'll skip Power/Play to draw twice without hesitation. It's hard to describe, because it really depends on the draw and the situation.</p>",
