      "created_at": "2013-02-06T05:57:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>AZ almost always ends with full health when we play, and depending on the setup often uses Coolant Blast or Thermal Shockwave for 30 or more damage in one hit. He is very powerful and nigh indestructible under the right circumstances.</p>",
